* Emphasis

** Bold

*bold* *bold text with spaces*

** Italic

/italic/ /italic text/

** Underline

_underline_ _underlined text_

** Strikethrough

+strikethrough+ +strikethrough text+

** Verbatim

=verbatim= =verbatim text with spaces=

** Code

~code~ ~inline code~

** Superscript

This is a ^{superscript} text

** Subscript

This is a _{subscript} text

** Escapes

Use \* \/ \_ \+ \= \~ to avoid emphasis: \*not bold\*, \/not italic\/.

\\ produces a line break.

