* Comments

** Line comments

Visible before.

# This line is a comment and is not rendered.

Visible after.

** Block comments

Visible before the block.

#+BEGIN_COMMENT
This entire block is a comment.
None of these lines are rendered.
#+END_COMMENT

Visible after the block.

